  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……灯織、顔つきが変わったよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………え？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんて言うのかな……\r\n前より、キリッとしてるっていうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ああ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』の最初の頃は悩んでいたので……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どこか軸がぶれていて、\r\nそれが顔に出ていたのかもしれません──が……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "キリッと……ってどういうことですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、うん、上手く言えないんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前だけを見ている、勇ましさみたいな感じかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『ああ、戦っている人の顔だな』って思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そんなに鬼気迫る感じでしたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああいや、悪い意味じゃないからな！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かっこいいなと思ったんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "悪い意味だとは思ってないです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ただ、ちょっと勢いが出すぎたかなと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全然隠すことじゃないじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……その……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自分ではどの程度なのか、よくわからないですし……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "わからないことを、きっかけである当人に指摘されると……",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200309/1002003090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003090140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "恥ずかしくて…………",
